# libretro cores built by cores/build.sh, one per line:
#   name  repo(github)  commit  dir  makefile  extra make args (rest of the line)
# Pinned upstream commits; `cores/build.sh <name>` or `cores/build.sh all`.
# pcsx_rearmed has its own recipe (cores/pcsx_rearmed/build.sh: core options checks), and
# so has ppsspp (cores/ppsspp/build.sh: CMake, git submodules, assets package).
# mupen64plus_next: hardware rendered (GLideN64 on GLES 3, RetroArch's gl driver), no PSC
# make target: the generic unix one with the 32-bit ARM dynarec (ARM mode) and NEON.
